{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46118","headline":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 一 · 贯休","name":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上玄大帝降坤维，箕尾爲臣副圣期。\n岂比赤光盈室日，全同白象下天时。\n文经武纬包三古，日角龙颜遏四夷。\n今日降神天上会，愿将天福比须弥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}